连续16周给药方案。需医学经理核验研究药物的作用机制、非临床与既往临床信息是否需补充，并确保与研究者手册一致。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f4c6d74bb8f27cadfa985a1f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922132544_7cc43516","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取合成试验药A的非临床研究总结报告或研究者手册中的非临床数据，涵盖药效学、药代动力学和毒理学结果，以完成本章正文。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_3_1_nonclinical_source","missing_source_classes":["非临床研究总结报告","研究者手册（IB）中的非临床数据","药效学研究资料","药代动力学研究资料"],"target":"2.3.1 非临床研究结果"}],"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["非临床研究总结报告","研究者手册（IB）中的非临床数据","药效学研究资料","药代动力学研究资料"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"允许来源中未提供合成试验药A的非临床研究数据，无法形成有实质信息且可溯源的正文；需医学经理核验非临床研究总结报告或研究者手册中的非临床数据来源。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0d1c72ba25343e73","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f4c6d74bb8f27cadfa985a1f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_c